hem out and I'm sure  they'd let him out because we give a lot  of aid to Pakistan we gave a lot of  money to Pakistan the Trump  administration has significantly cut  financial aid to Pakistan in hopes of  pushing Islamabad away from its  historical and traditional ties to  militants but so far Pakistani leaders  have refused president Trump's multiple  requests to release dr. Alfred E who  continues to languish in a Pakistani  prison to this day Brett can repeal in  our Middle East newsroom  Connor thank you
 

